WEBVTT

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:10.460
You're in a good mood, Master.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.490
Well, yeah.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:15.990
Just thinking about the expression 
on Zola's face makes me hum.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.100
And then there's this island.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.630
I'm an independent knight now.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:27.750
I'm lucky I found an uninhabited island 
suitable for a baronet on the way home.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.300
In the future, it could probably make you 
some money as a tourist destination.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.330
You could build hot springs 
using heat-producing crystals.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.760
Hot springs! Hot springs are nice!

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.260
I've already begun making preparations.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.930
It should be quite comfortable 
in a few months.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.120
Now I just need to find a wife at the academy,

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.690
and I can live an easy life 
as a back country baronet.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.820
What?! A baron?!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:56.610
Yeah, apparently, they're granting 
Leon Fou Bartfort a barony.

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:58.570
B-But why?

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:03.950
Probably for clearing an unexplored dungeon 
and discovering a new floating island.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:07.340
Th-That island's only big 
enough for a baronet!

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:12.090
I chose that rank for a reason. 
If I become a baron...

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:16.420
You'll have to find a high-ranking 
wife at the academy.

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:17.470
One around Zola's rank.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:19.100
Zola?

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.610
Zola?!

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.980
Please, no!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.400
<b>Trapped in</b>

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.740
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:43.370
<b>Trapped in
a Dating Sim</b>

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:02.090
<i>The royal capital of Holfort Kingdom.</i>

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.840
<i>Located in the middle of a massive continent,</i>

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:09.040
<i>this modern and beautiful city 
exists in harmony with nature.</i>

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:13.790
<i>With a population of over one million, the 
community is centered around the nobility.</i>

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.960
Wow, it's exactly like the 
academy from the game.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:19.700
<i>For the next three years,</i>

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.580
<i>I'll be looking for a wife here while studying</i>

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:26.720
<i>noble etiquette, adventuring 
dos and don'ts, and even magic.</i>

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:29.980
<i>I've finally reached the 
starting point of the game.</i>

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.920
Pick up my bag at once.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.480
Forgive me, mistress.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.480
<i>Women really do hold more 
power in this world.</i>

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.740
<i>I wanna go home.</i>

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.370
It's the prince and his friends!

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.620
<i>Ah, it's the romantic interests.</i>

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.870
<i>So these are the guys I was pursuing.</i>

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.500
<i>They still annoy me ten years later.</i>

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.140
Look at that.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.880
That's the Redgrave girl.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.660
<i>Rich girl antagonist Angelica.</i>

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.270
<i>She's the protagonist's rival</i>

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:05.890
<i>and the daughter of the duke who's second 
in power only to the royal family.</i>

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.820
<i>She got in the way of my 
romances so many times.</i>

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.360
She's so pretty.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.450
That's the duke's family for you.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:13.360
The average man isn't good enough for her.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:17.510
<i>Welp, good luck with your noble 
business, noble lords and ladies.</i>

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:19.900
<i>I'll be doing things the mob way.</i>

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:21.830
That took forever.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:24.910
Hey, Girl. Wanna Get Some Tea?

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.360
I wonder who we'll be placed with.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.500
Classes start tomorrow, huh?

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.490
I hope I'm in the same class 
as some distinguished nobles.

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.910
I wonder what our class is like.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:31.980
<i>So sleepy. I guess entrance ceremonies 
are boring even in an isekai.</i>

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.950
D-Did you just hit me?

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:39.300
Do you have any idea who I am?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:44.930
N-No. But regardless of who you are, 
I won't t-tolerate such rudeness.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:47.480
<i>Huh? That dialogue...</i>

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:51.430
You're not like other girls.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.510
<i>That's an event from the game.</i>

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:56.440
<i>But isn't this...</i>

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.860
<i>She's not that protagonist.</i>

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:08.070
<i>I feel like I've seen her somewhere before.</i>

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:09.490
Master.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.090
Luxion, how was the city?

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:15.910
My own scientific technology 
is far more advanced.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:20.380
I will have to do more 
research into magic, however.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.090
So there was a lot to see, then?

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.380
You're not very honest about 
you feelings, you tsundere.

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:30.570
Tsundere? Are you hoping I will 
take on a female role for you?

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:35.080
As I have no gender, I cannot 
respond to those feelings.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.890
God, you piss me off.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:40.620
You're studying already? 
You didn't seem that motivated.

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:41.770
I'm not studying.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.350
I'm preparing for a tea party.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.780
Daniel, Raymond.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:53.410
Got any leads on girls like us 
who aren't from wealthy families?

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.460
Absolutely not. Right, Raymond?

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:59.790
I don't care who they are as long 
as they'll attend my tea party.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.220
We're only doing this to please the girls,

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:04.850
but if word gets out that we 
can't even host tea parties,

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:07.050
it'll make it harder to get married.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.330
Your Highness!

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.030
Are you holding a tea party?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:14.040
I'd like to come!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:14.930
Me, too!

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.670
This year will be tough since 
there's the prince and other

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:19.350
distinguished nobles around.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:23.530
Girls who act coldly toward us 
lose their heads over them.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.690
Give me a break.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.100
Your Highness.

00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.950
I must speak with you 
regarding your tea party.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.580
May I join you?

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:39.460
Angelica, don't try to intimidate me. 
We're at the academy.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:45.460
I am aware. It's just... 
it's a bit noisy in your vicinity.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:49.220
She seems on edge.

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:52.970
Don't look. Don't attract 
attention. Don't get involved.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.970
Um, excuse me...

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.310
Marie, I've been looking for you.

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.600
You called for me, Your Highness?

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:05.960
I'll be holding my own tea party soon.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.880
I'd like you to come.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:08.480
What?

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.840
Hold on.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.610
She would be out of place at your tea party.

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:14.530
I'm here at this school 
as one of its students.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:18.870
You may be my fiancée, but you have no right 
to meddle in my affairs to this degree.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.870
F-Forgive me.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.060
<i>This is a compulsory event from the game.</i>

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:29.130
<i>The protagonist is supposed to be 
protected by the prince, but...</i>

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.630
Sorry about that, Marie.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:36.890
It's all right. Are you sure it would be 
acceptable for me to attend, though?

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:41.630
I've never seen you pursue a girl 
so aggressively, Your Highness.

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:43.380
S-Stop it, Jilk.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:47.520
I-In any case, I'd like you to attend.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:48.980
Your Highness...

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:50.780
I will.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.180
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:02.790
A tea party is a mirror that 
reflects who a person is.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.390
From your behavior to your words,

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:12.520
each and every tea and snack served at 
a tea party expresses who a person is.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:09.950
<i>Ugh, what a drag.</i>

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:13.230
<i>I can't believe I'm attending an 
etiquette class with a bunch of dudes.</i>

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:14.050
Mr. Leon.

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.550
Yes, sir.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.560
If you would please listen more attentively.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.750
That's the adventurer 
everyone's talking about.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.320
This is the problem with country folk.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:24.710
He thinks he's so great just because 
he's accomplished a little.

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.210
He's just a baron's son.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:27.560
<i>Shut up.</i>

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:33.910
Mr. Leon, it is important to want to 
invite women into a special place.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.100
Uh-huh.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:37.070
You don't seem to understand.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:40.580
Why don't I show you? To the front, please.

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:43.670
Wow, I'm so excited.

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:46.830
<i>Tea party, my ass.</i>

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.590
<i>It's just a dumb event 
for winning girls over.</i>

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:51.590
Sir!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.940
Do you understand now?

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:57.380
Yes, sir. I'm ashamed
I ever made fun of them.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:01.110
Someday I hope to hold tea 
parties as perfect as yours.

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:04.100
I still have a lot to learn myself.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.600
Let us walk the path of tea together.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.610
Yes, sir—no, Master!

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.550
What happened to him?

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:13.810
Who knows?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.610
You're making quite the effort.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:21.830
Until recently, you planned to hire 
help and take it easy yourself.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:25.250
It's all thanks to my master. 
I've been reborn.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:29.590
It's impressive that you've rented this space, 
but are any women actually coming?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:32.000
Oh, she will. She's the daughter of a baron.

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:34.010
See? Here she is now.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.250
Thank you for coming to—

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:36.790
Huh?

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.000
Yo.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:40.430
Uh, you didn't come alone?

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:44.270
Nah. I brought my friends and their servant.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:47.520
Hey, there's a bunch of snacks.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:52.600
We're going to Brad's tea party, 
but we've got some time until then.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.650
I thought we could have some tea.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.150
I want some, too.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:58.780
Hurry up.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.630
I'm thirsty.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:00.160
Tastes all right.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.030
Well, should we get going?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.160
Yeah.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:07.920
Thanks. This was a decent 
way to pass the time.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:08.810
Later.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:09.920
Later.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.960
But you'll have to spend a little more 
on snacks if you want to please girls.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:21.570
<i>Master, the path of tea 
is long and treacherous.</i>

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:22.350
What?

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.940
Who do you think you are?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:26.310
Did Brad invite you?

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.970
Know your place.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.180
Idiot.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.970
Why don't you clean up the trash, commoner?

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:36.140
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:37.690
<i>That girl...</i>

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:42.320
Is this what they call bullying?
I believe she's here on a scholarship.

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:43.810
<i>Olivia...</i>

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.570
<i>She's the protagonist of this game.</i>

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:00.220
<i>I don't really want to get involved 
with the game's story, but...</i>

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.280
Hey, girl.

00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:05.600
Wanna get some tea?

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.230
This is delicious.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:18.250
I've never had such delicious sweets.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.590
Can I have this tea, too?

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:23.740
Yeah. It was about to go to waste, anyway.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.940
This was a decent way to pass the time.

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:28.640
Hurry up, slowpoke.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:31.000
Serve more expensive stuff next time.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.000
It's so good.

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:38.400
<i>Seriously? She's such a sweet girl.</i>

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.760
<i>What kind of idiot would call her devious?</i>

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.260
What a devious protagonist.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:51.390
Hey, are things always like that for you?

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:57.370
Nothing I do ever goes well.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:12:01.030
I'm not even sure if it was all right for a 
commoner like me to come to this school.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.130
It's obviously all right.

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:05.410
<i>I mean, you are the protagonist.</i>

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:09.530
I want to study magic more,

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:14.740
but I don't know much about the academy's 
rules and unspoken agreements.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.790
Oh, don't cry.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:20.780
I know one person we can count on.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.550
She may be able to help us.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.050
What?

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.300
Really?

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.220
<i>She's blinding me!</i>

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:32.060
So you called me, idiot brother?

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.810
Try to make yourself useful sometimes.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.310
You've mooched plenty of money off me.

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:41.340
You said your name's Olivia, right?

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:44.480
Have you introduced yourself to the 
most important girl in your class?

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:49.080
No. She has so many followers, 
I can't get close.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.850
In those situations,

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:54.620
you have to ask one of her important 
followers to act as a go-between.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.830
Give her a gift of something she likes.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.640
You mean a bribe.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:02.340
It works, okay? Don't question it!

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:05.420
Get her some snacks from a popular shop.

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:08.000
S-Snacks from a popular shop?

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.350
Those are expensive, aren't they?

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.730
Get him to pay for it.

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.410
What? You can't just decide that!

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:17.980
100 dia...

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:19.490
200 dia...

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:24.080
It's all right. I'll pay for it.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.670
I-I promise I'll pay you back.

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:31.550
I don't know who told you to do it,

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:33.860
but you deserve some praise for 
coming to introduce yourself.

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:35.750
Th-Thank you.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:40.630
I'll allow you to sit quietly in the 
corner so long as you know your place.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:44.650
D-Does that mean it's all right 
for me to be at the academy?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.140
U-Um, I...

00:13:56.530 --> 00:14:00.630
You were supposed to just silently nod. 
Then it would've all been over.

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:04.650
Now things have become complicated 
because you had to ask a question.

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:06.030
Huh?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:10.580
I'm not trying to push 
you out of the academy.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:13.910
I don't have the time to do that, 
nor do I enjoy such crude behavior.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:18.920
R-Really? I'm sorry.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.640
I suppose you're better than that 
girl who's cozying up to the prince.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:30.370
Scholarship student, 
who advised you to do this?

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:31.930
It was Mr. Leon.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:34.730
The third son of the Bartfort family?

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:37.780
The one who acquired a barony on his own?

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.440
He's an impressive fellow.

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.440
Isn't he?

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:47.940
But his competence will mean 
others will want to use him.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:56.700
Damn it, Daniel and Raymond.

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.710
They skipped exploration class.

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:04.710
<i>To make matters worse, my classmates 
are all the romantic interests.</i>

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:09.350
I'm sorry. The others insisted 
on their attendance.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.720
<i>On top of that...</i>

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.790
Let's let them go ahead.

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.710
Let them handle the dangerous stuff.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:18.730
They're an experienced adventurer 
and a scholarship student, anyway.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:23.730
<i>They're treating us like a convenient 
couple of guards—no, meat shields.</i>

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.580
All right, everyone.

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:28.950
This is an opportunity to apply the magic 
and fighting techniques you've learned.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:32.990
Please descend to the third floor of the 
dungeon and collect the crystals there.

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:35.800
Watch out for monsters.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.570
Yes, ma'am.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.570
Got it.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.070
Shall we go, Ms. Olivia?

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:40.980
Okay.

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:42.460
That's enough!

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:45.050
I told you to know your place.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.520
You and the prince are of vastly 
different social standings!

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:52.010
Angelica, don't.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:56.260
Your Highness, you're going to 
allow this girl to have her way?

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:01.140
I just wanted to be with the prince.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.770
If I'm bothering you, you can say so.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.020
How dare you act like this again?

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:07.800
What's going on?

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:08.670
Are they fighting again?

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:09.210
What happened?

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:13.410
Hey, Ms. Olivia. Do you know 
anything about that Marie girl?

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:17.090
I believe she's the daughter 
of a poor viscount.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:20.540
Recently, she's been bullied 
even worse than me.

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:21.750
Huh...

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.120
How could she cozy up to him like 
that in front of his fiancee?

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.990
Wasn't she getting pretty friendly 
with some other boys, too?

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:28.800
She sucks. I can't believe her.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.800
Enough of this!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:35.680
Ms. Angelica, please don't 
trouble the prince too much.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:39.160
Don't bring your outside 
relationships into the academy.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.680
It's irritating.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.980
I-I'm just trying to do what's 
best for the prince...

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.160
Let's go, Marie.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:46.690
A-All right.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:56.290
<i>Women may hold more power in this 
world, but they're the exception.</i>

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:58.260
Huff...

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:05.460
Mr. Leon, I managed to excavate a crystal.

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:08.800
Congratulations. That's 100 dia in the bag.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:12.870
Absolutely. Now I can pay back 
the money I borrowed from you.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:14.970
There's no rush.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:18.860
Aren't there treasure 
chests in dungeons, too?

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:22.220
I wonder who left them there.
It's strange, isn't it?

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.730
Yeah, it sure is strange.

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.800
Mr. Leon, you're not curious?

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.480
Not really.

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:32.380
Mr. Leon, you're so cold.

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.900
<i>There's no point in questioning it.</i>

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:39.660
<i>After all, this is one of those vaguely-conceived 
dungeons from that otome game.</i>

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.780
<i>Honestly, getting any closer to 
Ms. Olivia would be a bad idea.</i>

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:47.410
<i>She's destined to become friends 
with the prince and his buddies.</i>

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.550
The others haven't arrived yet.

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:54.530
Of course not. We're just 
meat shields to them.

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:00.280
M-Mr. Leon!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.070
We should get help from 
the others immediately!

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:06.910
There's no point. They intended for us 
to serve as their shields from the start.

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:08.180
But...

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:12.010
Seriously, I hope those rich kids drop dead.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:16.530
<i>I guess I'll test out this sword Luxion made.</i>

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:26.790
Last one!

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.970
Y-You're so strong.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:34.270
I used to train back home.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.630
I've fought nastier creatures, too.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.580
You little...

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.560
That thing scared me.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.110
I-I'm sorry. You were protecting me.

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:55.960
Mr. Leon...

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.190
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.390
We'll handle the rest.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.700
<i>They've got some balls.</i>

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:08.710
Marie, are you scared?

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.710
No, I'm fine.

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:15.440
I'm more worried about the prince.

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.210
Guys raised in the palace tend to be weak.

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:21.220
Hey, don't be rude to the prince.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:24.720
We're students now. We're equals here.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:28.290
This guy will put you through 
hell if you marry him, Marie.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:39.490
Meatheads!

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:46.620
We must assist him!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:51.120
Calm down. The prince isn't a weak man.

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:02.130
Your Highness, you're hurt!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.240
I-It's just a scratch.

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:18.020
M-Marie, you can use healing magic?

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:19.540
Shh.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:20.780
Your Highness!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.030
Marie!

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:25.780
Are you all right? Let me treat your wounds.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:29.790
That's not necessary.

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:30.860
Huh?

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:33.210
Are you all right, Marie?

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:34.790
Y-Yes.

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:40.250
Your Highness, why are you 
holding hands with Marie?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.800
Don't try to get the jump on us.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.350
Did you see that?

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:45.430
I feel sorry for her.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:47.520
Is she really his fiancée?

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:53.430
Mr. Leon, you're hurt!

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:55.940
This is nothing.

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:58.440
I'll heal you.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.550
Thanks.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.230
Magic is the only thing I'm good at.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:15.620
I began attending this academy because 
a scholar discovered my talent.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.210
That's impressive.

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:20.560
I'm glad to have been 
useful to you, Mr. Leon.

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:24.900
<i>Well, damn it.</i>

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:28.720
<i>She's the protagonist, and I'm 
just a mob character, but...</i>

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:33.420
<i>Anyway, what's going on?</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.600
<i>Why is this different from the game?</i>

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:27.920
You challenge someone to a duel by 
throwing your glove at them, right?

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:29.900
That's right. It's also how you 
declare the end of a friendship.

00:23:29.900 --> 00:23:31.090
It's not something one should do rashly.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:32.310
Huh, I had no idea.

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.050
You didn't even know that?

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:35.850
Are you looking for a fight? Bring it on.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.760
Let's duel, prince.

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:40.020
I just told you not to be rash.
